  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Operational dashboard for the workflow execution and Kafka messaging leg (S13-15).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {},
      "mode": "markdown",
      "content": "# Workflow / Kafka \u2014 operational (S13-15)\n\nEvery panel is a bounded `agentflow.*` meter over the dedicated Prometheus (`agentflow-prometheus`, the S13-05 store); no identifiers, no payloads. **Stuck-worker signal:** outbox pending / oldest age / consumer lag rising while runs by state stop moving \u2014 no database peek needed. Use the links (top right) for Logs and Traces."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Run transitions by state (rate/s)",
      "description": "Successful run transitions per second, one series per target state (bounded, lowercased WorkflowRunState vocabulary).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "agentflow-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "agentflow-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (state) (rate(agentflow_workflowexecution_run_total[5m]))",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Run duration p95 / p99 (seconds)",
      "description": "95th and 99th percentile of run duration (run creation \u2192 terminal transition). A persistent p99 spike is a stalled terminal transition.",
